  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Prosecutor&apos;s Office, Laos</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">&#xc5;klagarv&#xe4;sendet, Laos</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d till &#xc5;klagarkontoret i Laos, som del av svenskt r&#xe4;ttsst&#xf6;d 2000- 2003, enligt beslut DESO /00, som multibi-st&#xf6;d genom UNDP. Syftet med projektet &#xe4;r fr&#xe4;mst att genom utbildningsinsatser h&#xf6;ja kompetenseninom laotiskt &#xe5;klagarv&#xe4;sende g&#xe4;llande nya lagar och procedurer.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the Office of the Public Prosecutor (OPP), as part of Swe- dish legal support, according to decision DESO /00, through a multibilateral agreement with UNDP. The objective is to raise the compe- tence of Laos&apos; prosecutors regarding new laws, procedures etc through i a training and education</narrative>
  </description>
